Z||000008||84Bill||12-18-2001||03:52 PM||||Here ya go, Kind of Dr Seussish but then again I always liked his style.<P>To My Family <BR>who have gathered from far or near<BR>to revel in the Christmas cheer<P>I wanted to take this time <BR>to put together a simple rhyme<P>something really short and sweet<BR>it comes not wrapped in a paper sheet<P>no bows or ribbons so neatly tied<BR>could replace what I feel inside<P>not in a box hidden from view<BR><B>is</B> this small gift of words for you <P>here it is for all to see<BR>Thank you for being my family <P><BR>Decided to add the is<BR>anyway feel free to alter it<p>[This message has been edited by 84Bill (edited 12-18-2001).]||||reg||1
