Z||000013||84Bill||12-19-2001||12:27 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by JSocha:<BR><B>I did give you a thumbs up Bill!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/confused.gif"> DOH!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif">  Of course, in certain circles I guess that could mean something entirely different.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/redface.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Yes JSocha it is true <BR>I am a poet and this is for you<P>for those that know and adore him<BR>a witty rogue of Pennocks forum<P>with big words he took on EdsB52<BR>struck Ed down made him pay his due<P>as the dust settled on that day<BR>we watched Ed stumble then crawl away<P>yes JSocha is the man<BR>making posts whenever he can<P>always expressing his point of view<BR>day or night even holidays too<P>making comment on this and that<BR>he has us covered like a jimmy hat<P>now take no offence J my friend<BR>we always respect in the end<P>one example if I may point out<BR>was a thread who wears a safety belt<P>now that I have been thinking for a while<BR>building a monument to you in rhyming style<P><BR>one thing to say before I bid adue<BR>to all my friend and those of opposing view<P><BR>We all have in common our beloved Fiero<BR>so lets hold hands and sing cume by ya melo<P>lastly I want to thank Cliff for this space<BR>and most of all for his benevolent grace<P>Peace  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||6
Z||000014||JSocha||12-19-2001||12:48 PM||||&lt;clapping&gt;  LOL!<P>A man of talented if not respected word,<BR>Seldom seen but often heard.<P>A friend to argue with and yet admiringly respect,<BR>Gives you the run for your money just for the heck.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>I admit his poetry is far better then mine,<BR>I need not challenge him here and this is just fine.<P>But today he has shown us another side to view,<BR>A good friend considered he will be to me if not you.<P>I leave now wishing you good will,<BR>Merry Christmas and Happy New Year my dear friend Bill!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">||||reg||14
