Z||000019||JSocha||12-19-2001||04:23 PM||||I found Ken's post actually quiet humourous,<BR>But in fact I agree it should remain less then numerous. <P>But I'm certainly not here to single anyone out,<BR>Ends up in a flame war which becomes a mindless and endless bout.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>I'm also not here to mindlessly fight,<BR>To the other members its not fair or right.<P>But lets do something for the forum that will most appropriately fit,<BR>A friendly post between us in which other members can enjoy as they sit.<P>Lets bring them in here for awhile,<BR>And turn a potential frown into a warm smile.<P>A little poetry war so to speak,<BR>A friendly one so noone else will freak.<P>Seemingly we have already begun,<BR>Why not continue and have some fun.<P>I'll just let you know before if we should begin,<BR>I'm neither here to lose nor am I here to win.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Hopefully the forum members will sit here for a spell,<BR>As my mind has started to flow like the fresh waters from an Artisian well.<P>I would ask the members not to cheer or side,<BR>Just enjoy the banter and free ride.<P>And I won't dazzle any member with any fancy a word,<BR>As Pennock's Forum knows it already had its share of its dictionary nerd.<P>So what do you say to a little fun my friend,<BR>Should we continue or should this we end?<P>The eyes are upon us for all to see,<BR>Hopefully we can make them go heee heee heee!||||reg||12
